<%= header %>
<%= benefit_type %>
*START*
VA Form 22-0989

EDUCATION BENEFIT ENTITLEMENT RESTORATION REQUEST DUE
            TO SCHOOL CLOSURE, PROGRAM SUSPENSION OR WITHDRAWAL
        -------------------------------------------------------

          PART I - APPLICANT IDENTIFICATION AND PERSONAL INFORMATION
          --------------------------------------------------------

1. NAME OF APPLICANT (First, Middle Initial, Last): <%= full_name(@applicant.applicantName) %>

2. VA FILE NUMBER (If unknown, provide your Social Security number): <%= va_file_number %>

3. CURRENT MAILING ADDRESS (Number and street or rural route, city or P.O.,
State and ZIP Code):
<%= full_address_with_street3(@applicant.mailingAddress) %>

4. TELEPHONE NUMBER (Include Area Code)

HOME: <%= home_phone %>

MOBILE: <%= mobile_phone %>

5. EMAIL ADDRESS: <%= @applicant.emailAddress %>

     PART II - INFORMATION NEEDED TO REVIEW FOR ENTITLEMENT RESTORATION
     ------------------------------------------------------------------

6A. DID YOUR SCHOOL CLOSE AND OR SUSPEND YOUR INDIVIDUAL PROGRAM OR WAS YOUR
PROGRAM WITHDRAWN?: <%= yesno(@applicant.schoolWasClosed) %>

6B. PROVIDE THE NAME AND ADDRESS OF YOUR SCHOOL THAT CLOSED OR WHERE YOUR
PROGRAM WAS WITHDRAWN OR SUSPENDED (If more space is needed use Item 12,
Remarks):
<%= closed_school_name_and_address %>

7A. DID YOU COMPLETE A PROGRAM OF STUDY AT THE CLOSED/DISAPPROVED SCHOOL?:
<%= conditional_yesno(@applicant.didCompleteProgramOfStudy, visible: school_closed_questions_visible?) %>

7B. DID YOU RECEIVE CREDIT FOR THE ENROLLED HOURS BEING ATTEMPTED AT THE TIME
OF THE CLOSURE, WITHDRAWAL OR SUSPENSION?: <%= conditional_yesno(@applicant.didReceiveCredit, visible: school_closed_questions_visible?) %>

7C. WERE YOU STILL ENROLLED IN THE PROGRAM OF STUDY WHEN THE SCHOOL CLOSED
WAS DISAPPROVED OR SUSPENDED YOUR PROGRAM?: <%= conditional_yesno(@applicant.wasEnrolledWhenSchoolClosed, visible: school_closed_questions_visible?) %>

7D. WERE YOU ON AN APPROVED LEAVE OF ABSENCE WHEN THE SCHOOL WAS
CLOSED/PROGRAM WAS SUSPENDED OR WITHDRAWN?: <%= conditional_yesno(@applicant.wasOnApprovedLeave, visible: school_closed_questions_visible?) %>

8A. DID YOU WITHDRAW FROM THE SCHOOL PRIOR TO THE SCHOOL CLOSING?:
<%= conditional_yesno(@applicant.withdrewPriorToClosing, visible: school_closed_questions_visible?) %>

8B. PROVIDE THE DATE OF WITHDRAWAL FROM THE SCHOOL: <%= conditional_date(@applicant.dateOfWithdraw, visible: withdraw_date_visible?) %>

9A. ARE YOU ENROLLED IN A COURSE OF STUDY AT A NEW SCHOOL?:
<%= conditional_yesno(@applicant.enrolledAtNewSchool, visible: school_closed_questions_visible?) %>

9B. PROVIDE THE FULL NAME OF YOUR NEW SCHOOL AND PROGRAM:
<%= new_school_and_program_name %>

9C. ARE YOU COMPLETING YOUR PROGRAM OF STUDY AT A NEW SCHOOL THROUGH A
TEACH-OUT AGREEMENT WITH THE CLOSED/DISAPPROVED SCHOOL?:
<%= conditional_yesno(@applicant.isUsingTeachoutAgreement, visible: new_school_questions_visible?) %>

9D. IF YOU ARE ATTENDING A NEW SCHOOL, DID THEY GRANT 12 OR MORE CREDIT HOURS
FOR COURSE(S) TAKEN FROM THE CLOSED/DISAPPROVED SCHOOL? (Please see Item 9D
on the Instructions Page): <%= conditional_yesno(@applicant.newSchoolGrants12OrMoreCredits, visible: new_school_questions_visible?) %>

10. IF YOU ATTENDED A NON-COLLEGE DEGREE (NCD) SCHOOL THAT WAS CLOSED,
SUSPENDED YOUR PROGRAM OR WAS DISAPPROVED, DID THAT SCHOOL TRANSFER ANY HOURS
OR CREDITS?: <%= conditional_yesno(@applicant.schoolDidTransferCredits, visible: school_closed_questions_visible?) %>

11. WHAT WAS YOUR LAST DATE OF ATTENDANCE AT THE CLOSED OR DISAPPROVED SCHOOL
OR IN THE SUSPENDED PROGRAM?: <%= conditional_date(@applicant.lastDateOfAttendance, visible: school_closed_questions_visible?) %>

12. REMARKS (If any):
<%= remarks %>

13. ATTESTATION OF HOURS TRANSFERRED

"By signing here, I acknowledge the following:
 a. I have transferred fewer than 12 credits from my program at the
closed/disapproved facility; and
 b. If I am transferred 12 or more credits from such program at a later date,
the Secretary will rescind/revoke my restored entitlement."

SIGNATURE: <%= attestation_signature %>

DATE: <%= attestation_date %>

          PART III - CERTIFICATION AND SIGNATURE OF APPLICANT
          ---------------------------------------------------

I CERTIFY THAT all statements in my application are true and correct to the
best of my knowledge and belief.

14A. SIGNATURE OF APPLICANT (DO NOT Print) (Sign in ink):
<%= @applicant.statementOfTruthSignature %>

14B. DATE SIGNED (MM,DD,YYYY): <%= format_date(@applicant.dateSigned) %>

<%= parse_with_template_path('footer') %>
